# Version 1.15's follow-up rounds, round 2 of 2, on Gray, on a fresh sample of the agents (seed 37): voice
# alone with two, four and six callers, for each count's SLO, and the configuration the rounds measured, the same with the
# agents' decodes held from a call's first 48 tokens (the opt-*-hold arms), and that with speculative decoding too
# (the opt-*-spec arms), beside 24 agent sessions of the discriminating scenario with 2, 4 and 6 callers.
#   FLATSHARE_GPU=NODE benchmarks/e2/campaign.sh --pause benchmarks/e2/opt-s2.campaign

agents-seed 37

